Package: fantastic-session
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Koreniuk Oleksandr (aisixteen) <kvazis@gmail.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: aisixteen-fantastic (= @VERSION@), cage, libpam-systemd, libpam-modules, libpam-runtime, systemd, passwd, init-system-helpers, libgl1-mesa-dri, fonts-dejavu-core
Homepage: https://github.com/aisixteen/fantastic
Description: boots this machine straight into fantastic
 A kiosk session: the user `fantastic` is logged in on tty1 automatically,
 and cage shows the fantastic desktop app (`fantastic-app --kiosk`) full
 screen, with screen blanking off. Installing it on a headless Debian makes
 that machine the kiosk from its next boot.
